{"title":"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>Prime Mates\n</pre>\n<p>Find the largest 9 digit integer in which no two digits are the same and the\nsum of each pair of adjacent digits is prime. That is, the sum of the first two digits is prime,\nthe sum of the second and third digits is prime, the sum of the third and fourth digits is prime,\nand so on.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since we want to maximize the integer, let's first start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/9/929e1522e4a0ce869acbe690ecc23576c1aedbe2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$987,654,321$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" />. Using a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greedy_algorithm\" title=\"Greedy algorithm\">greedy algorithm</a>, we can do this series of changes (commas omitted):\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288f6632744eb9c7d6ea805e1c1ebf65a3ddad75.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(98)7654321\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/b/61baffe9280d723464fac98de56bcb0072c1d5c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9(85)764321\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42bea1f5838d7715ba5161e26f5bc9c125e51035.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[98(56)74321\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/3567f9ffe175bad9bf98ca23e64a254fa105b333.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[985(67)4321\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/5/fe5289eb3e648fe6288e04ab2be1714f5a746f80.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9856(74)321\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/7/217b70fb64d3f00b708c46356a63e23ceee5a75e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[985674(32)1\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/c/6ac0965212ab0562c645916e41a4718b06e18e1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[9856743(21)\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />\nThus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/5/7b5b79747ec62d1b6eaf1d6496b5f196838062a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{985674321}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"95\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/3/f134a4eedaa2b3343bbd858ce9d2d1a1c731656d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{985,674,321}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"111\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II\">2017 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2017 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/P